From: Paulo Gomes <paulo@entire.io>
Subject: [PATCH] index: add rsl

Lists entireio/entire-rsl as the official rsl plugin so
`entire plugin install rsl` resolves it.

Drafted against entireio/plugin-index at 9bb4595. Not opened as a PR.
The repository must publish a release with checksums.txt first.

Signed-off-by: Paulo Gomes <paulo@entire.io>
---
diff --git a/index.json b/index.json
index acc02c6..b1e9e42 100644
--- a/index.json
+++ b/index.json
@@ -13,6 +13,12 @@
       "description": "Run a multi-agent investigation against a topic, issue, or seed doc",
       "official": true
     },
+    {
+      "name": "rsl",
+      "repo_url": "https://github.com/entireio/entire-rsl",
+      "description": "Inspect the gittuf Reference State Log of branches, tags and Entire checkpoints, and verify them against gittuf policy",
+      "official": true
+    },
     {
       "name": "run",
       "repo_url": "https://github.com/entireio/entire-run",
